  "thig1.2:0.3": "1. 2. ",
  "thig1.2:1.1": "mutte muccassu yogehi ",
  "thig1.2:1.2": "cando rāhuggahā iva, ",
  "thig1.2:1.3": "vippamuttena cittena ",
  "thig1.2:1.4": "anaṇā bhuñja piṇḍakanti. ",
  "thig1.2:2.1": "itthaṃ sudaṃ bhagavā muttaṃ sikkhamānaṃ imāya gāthāya abhiṇhaṃ ovadatī’ti. muttātherīgāthā. "
}
